Good luck dodging my attacks now that you can't use your eyes!

271
00:19:11,427 --> 00:19:13,427
Farewell!

272
00:19:13,427 --> 00:19:14,427
Farewell!

273
00:19:14,427 --> 00:19:38,367
You only see with your eyes?

274
00:19:38,367 --> 00:19:40,267
Some swordsman you are.

275
00:19:40,647 --> 00:19:41,427
Get lost!

276
00:19:44,427 --> 00:19:54,187
You just got lucky that time.

277
00:19:54,607 --> 00:19:58,707
I'm destined to be the number one swordsman and I'll cut down anyone who stands in my way.

278
00:20:06,027 --> 00:20:08,287
Well then, you've got a long way to go.

279
00:20:11,407 --> 00:20:12,567
Not again!

280
00:20:14,427 --> 00:20:17,287
We told you we're on your side!

281
00:20:20,587 --> 00:20:22,787
What new level of drunk is this?

282
00:20:23,127 --> 00:20:24,827
I don't know, but I'm scared.

283
00:20:25,367 --> 00:20:26,607
He's stronger than usual.

284
00:20:26,787 --> 00:20:27,227
Get ready.

285
00:20:29,447 --> 00:20:30,127
Tottering.

286
00:20:30,127 --> 00:20:40,687
He cut the net like paper!

287
00:20:40,687 --> 00:20:44,827
I don't get it.

288
00:20:44,987 --> 00:20:47,807
He was writhing in pain and then he changed color.

289
00:20:47,807 --> 00:20:52,907
Yeah, I don't get it either, but that's exactly what happened to Horty when he transformed.

290
00:20:53,447 --> 00:20:56,307
At least Horty had the decency not to swing swords at us.

291
00:20:56,307 --> 00:21:00,027
Oh, this feels good.

292
00:21:00,247 --> 00:21:01,327
So much energy.

293
00:21:02,367 --> 00:21:03,307
Let's see.

294
00:21:03,867 --> 00:21:05,647
Now, who should I butcher next?

295
00:21:06,127 --> 00:21:07,267
Don't be shy!

296
00:21:08,707 --> 00:21:10,067
What do we do now?

297
00:21:10,327 --> 00:21:12,987
He's not going to quit slashing until somebody stops him!

298
00:21:12,987 --> 00:21:17,307
Oh, come on.

299
00:21:17,307 --> 00:21:18,307
Who's it going to be?

300
00:21:18,847 --> 00:21:19,127
Huh?

301
00:21:19,127 --> 00:21:32,127
This is just way too many swords.

302
00:21:32,127 --> 00:21:43,587
Finally, a worthy opponent.

303
00:21:44,047 --> 00:21:45,747
That last guy was too easy.

304
00:21:46,867 --> 00:21:47,687
Hold on.

305
00:21:47,907 --> 00:21:48,787
You heard me.

306
00:21:48,987 --> 00:21:50,487
I'm calling dibs on him.

307
00:21:51,247 --> 00:21:54,207
We might as well get a warm-up before we go to the new world.

308
00:21:54,547 --> 00:21:55,407
Should be fun.

309
00:21:55,407 --> 00:22:05,727
That sucks.

310
00:22:05,967 --> 00:22:07,527
I guess it's not as strong underwater.

311
00:22:07,947 --> 00:22:09,127
Not as strong?

312
00:22:09,367 --> 00:22:09,947
Tough luck.

313
00:22:10,487 --> 00:22:12,047
Look, give it up already.

314
00:22:12,767 --> 00:22:15,167
We're thousands of meters underwater, you fool.

315
00:22:15,627 --> 00:22:18,947
You can fight, but there's no way in hell you're going to win.

316
00:22:19,147 --> 00:22:20,247
Not against a fish man.

317
00:22:21,247 --> 00:22:21,767
See?

318
00:22:22,507 --> 00:22:25,227
Either way, the whole island is doomed.

319
00:22:26,127 --> 00:22:30,267
That includes your friends, the princess, and everyone else down there.

320
00:22:31,187 --> 00:22:32,387
You're just a weakling.

321
00:22:32,667 --> 00:22:32,967
Get it?

322
00:22:33,207 --> 00:22:34,607
You can't protect anyone.

323
00:22:36,467 --> 00:22:37,467
Watch me.

324
00:22:55,407 --> 00:22:59,827
I'll save them all.

325
00:23:00,187 --> 00:23:02,487
I trained for two years.

326
00:23:03,127 --> 00:23:04,107
I'm ready.

327
00:23:04,107 --> 00:23:13,127
The Straw Hat Pirates go head-to-head with the powerful officers from Horty's crew.

328
00:23:13,447 --> 00:23:17,827
Thanks to their two years of training, they hold their own with a flurry of new fighting techniques.

329
00:23:18,107 --> 00:23:26,087
However, their struggle will all be for naught if Luffy cannot find a way to overcome Horty and stop the Noah from crushing Fishman Island.

330
00:23:26,087 --> 00:23:28,167
On the next, One Piece.

331
00:23:28,527 --> 00:23:30,207
A massive, confused fight.

332
00:23:30,487 --> 00:23:33,267
The Straw Hats versus the new Fishman Pirates.

333
00:23:33,607 --> 00:23:35,267
I'm going to be king of the pirates.

334
00:23:35,267 --> 00:23:35,467
The força.

335
00:23:35,987 --> 00:23:40,527
The worms fight.

336
00:23:40,787 --> 00:23:57,207
The

